    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STORY:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A second chance. A name you hadn\u2019t spoken in years. And suddenly\u2026 you were home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a decade, you return  to the town of Flowerbud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...But the town isn\u2019t how you remember it. Once a familiar place full of life, it is now the opposite: quiet and crumbling. Locals have drifted apart. Tourism has  almost vanished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The spirit of the town is fading. It\u2019s up to you to remind the locals of their bonds, restore the land, and perhaps, even find love?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GAME FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > RECONNECT AND RESTORE: Rebuild trust between villagers, bring life back to the town, and experience deep, branching relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ROMANCE OR FRIENDSHIP: Date a diverse cast, or build a lifelong bond with a 'Best Friend' \u2014 no romance required!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YOUR SHOP, YOUR STYLE:  Customize your shop to reflect your personal style and attract unique customers - who knows who may visit?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > BALANCE WORK AND PLAY: Manage your shop by day, explore and grow your connections at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLAY YOUR WAY:  Choose how YOU want to shape Flowerbud\u2019s future. Multiple endings await!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STORY:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A second chance. A name you hadn\u2019t spoken in years. And suddenly\u2026 you were home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a decade, you return  to the town of Flowerbud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...But the town isn\u2019t how you remember it. Once a familiar place full of life, it is now the opposite: quiet and crumbling. Locals have drifted apart. Tourism has  almost vanished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The spirit of the town is fading. It\u2019s up to you to remind the locals of their bonds, restore the land, and perhaps, even find love?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GAME FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > RECONNECT AND RESTORE: Rebuild trust between villagers, bring life back to the town, and experience deep, branching relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ROMANCE OR FRIENDSHIP: Date a diverse cast, or build a lifelong bond with a 'Best Friend' \u2014 no romance required!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YOUR SHOP, YOUR STYLE:  Customize your shop to reflect your personal style and attract unique customers - who knows who may visit?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > BALANCE WORK AND PLAY: Manage your shop by day, explore and grow your connections at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLAY YOUR WAY:  Choose how YOU want to shape Flowerbud\u2019s future. Multiple endings await!</p>",
